    <briefdescription>
<para>Large context size scenario for process retriever. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> Graph traversal yields &gt;1 MB context <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Truncate context and log warning <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> <computeroutput>PROC_MAX_CONTEXT_EXCEEDED</computeroutput> with truncation marker <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Query completes (no OOM crash)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Context is truncated cleanly</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Truncation marker in result</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Latency &lt;500 ms (P95) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
